{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to pile up your toys to make a track for your radio-controlled cars?\u00a0 <strong>Obstacle Overdrive</strong> offers room after room of tracks to explore that would ordinarily get you in trouble. \u00a0<strong>Parents not included.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a Racing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each car and take on crazy tracks filled with obstacles.\u00a0 Take your time and enjoy the challenge of each obstacle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Unique Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the cars you unlock while playing has its own personality and driving style.\u00a0 See if you can beat every level with each car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumble down hills, go car bowling, drive over seesaws and log bridges, go through marble pits, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fun hats for the cars scattered throughout the game.\u00a0 Use coins to unlock new paint jobs to personalize each car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>90s Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back in time with us to the 1990s, before tech took over our lives and we had to make our own entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412490?t=1772095582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/6498dc3e4dff99a20a3879a444503700a7330c44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772095582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/d41bb23e52aa2cfad947311f60102853a7d6a799/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772095582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/d41bb23e52aa2cfad947311f60102853a7d6a799/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772095582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4397900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to pile up your toys to make a track for your radio-controlled cars?\u00a0 <strong>Obstacle Overdrive</strong> offers room after room of tracks to explore that would ordinarily get you in trouble. \u00a0<strong>Parents not included.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a Racing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each car and take on crazy tracks filled with obstacles.\u00a0 Take your time and enjoy the challenge of each obstacle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Unique Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the cars you unlock while playing has its own personality and driving style.\u00a0 See if you can beat every level with each car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumble down hills, go car bowling, drive over seesaws and log bridges, go through marble pits, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fun hats for the cars scattered throughout the game.\u00a0 Use coins to unlock new paint jobs to personalize each car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.poster.avif?t=1772095582\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.webm?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.mp4?t=1772095582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>90s Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back in time with us to the 1990s, before tech took over our lives and we had to make our own entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extr